OL,3,GNEWSAJersey's police vacancies cut to
OL,4,Ameet savings
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's police force will no longer
OL,7,Ffill some of its job vacancies in order
OL,8,Fto meet savings targets for next year.
OL,10,FRobin Smith, the chief officer of the
OL,11,FStates of Jersey Police, told a
OL,12,Fscrutiny panel he had been asked to
OL,13,Fsave #120,000 in 2027 by the Justice
OL,14,Fand Home Affairs department.
OL,16,FHe said it would be a challenge as in
OL,17,Frecent years the force had "effectively
OL,18,Fstood still whilst demand has gone up".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
