OL,3,GNEWSAJersey's police vacancies cut to
OL,4,Ameet savings
OL,5,
OL,6,FJustice minister Senator Helen Miles
OL,7,Fsaid the savings plan was about
OL,8,F"maximising the potential" to share
OL,9,Fresources.
